# hypernix.table API reference

Implementation: `src/hypernix/monitoring/table.py`

## `Table()`

Minimal tabular view over ``rows``, a list of ``dict[str, Any]``.

## `Table.from_training_log(cls, path) -> Table`

Load step/loss pairs from a training stdout capture.

## `Table.from_judge_corpus(cls, path) -> Table`

Load ``<JUDGE_PROMPT>...<JUDGE_LABEL>...`` lines.

## `Table.select(*columns) -> Table`

Drop every column not in ``columns``.
